# Namespace Cloud Provider

The Namespace provider enables infrastructure-as-code management for [Namespace Cloud](https://namespace.so) services, including GitHub Actions runner profiles, IAM tenant groups, container registry policies, shared container images, read-only observability data sources, and short-lived ephemeral credentials.

> **Community provider:** This provider is published and maintained by `bsuv`. It is not an official Namespace Labs product and is not currently affiliated with or endorsed by Namespace Labs.

## Requirements

- [Terraform](https://www.terraform.io/downloads.html) >= 1.11.0
- Protocol 6 compliant Terraform binary

